Package: FundR
Title: Retrieve Fund Data from Eastmoney
Version: 0.0.1.9002
Authors@R: c(
    person("Guo Meng", , , "tony2015116@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Guo Meng", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Retrieves the Eastmoney fund directory and historical net asset
    values for funds that publish net asset value data. Returns fund codes,
    dates, trailing returns, and net asset values in data frames. Reviews
    historical returns and drawdowns against a user-specified loss limit.
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.1.1),
    jsonlite,
    xml2
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Suggests: 
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0)
VignetteBuilder: 
    knitr
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
URL: https://github.com/tony2015116/FundR
BugReports: https://github.com/tony2015116/FundR/issues
